Better Trading 2 — licensing
============================

Better Trading 2 is an unofficial community rewrite of Better Trading
(https://github.com/exile-center/better-trading). It is made of two parts,
under two licenses:

1. The new code written for Better Trading 2, and its own new icon and
   store artwork (store/), are released into the public domain under
   The Unlicense (Part 1 below).

2. Everything carried over or adapted from the original Better Trading —
   its icons and images, styles (CSS), wording, layout/design structure, and
   code adapted from it (for example the bookmark storage and share-string
   formats and the result enhancers) — remains under the original MIT License
   of Exile Center (Part 2 below). That notice must be kept with any copy
   that includes those parts.

Bundled third-party components keep their own licenses (Part 3 below).


