-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Part 3 — Bundled third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Preact (bundled into content.js) — MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2015-present Jason Miller. https://github.com/preactjs/preact
  (the MIT permission notice and disclaimer quoted in Part 2 apply to it,
  with this copyright line)

- Font Awesome Free 5 icons (SVG paths bundled into content.js) — icons
  licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/),
  code MIT. Copyright Fonticons, Inc. https://fontawesome.com/license/free

- assets/images/bookmark-folder/ holds Path of Exile currency and
  ascendancy artwork, carried over from Better Trading. This artwork is
  owned by Grinding Gear Games; it is not covered by the licenses above and
  is used only to illustrate bookmark folders.

- assets/data/poe1-tiers.json is generated from RePoE data
  (https://github.com/repoe-fork/repoe-fork.github.io), which is extracted
  from Path of Exile game files. Path of Exile and its game data are
  property of Grinding Gear Games.

Better Trading 2 is not affiliated with or endorsed by Exile Center or
Grinding Gear Games.
